message: "If you use this benchmark, its data or its harness, please cite it as below."
title: "Web Search API Eval: a web search API evaluation for AI agents"
abstract: >-
  A live, side-by-side evaluation of four web search APIs for AI agents (You.com, Tavily, Exa and Parallel)
  on 30 agent-style queries across GTM, insurance and finance, with 3 runs per query, graded with the
  SimpleQA rubric and FreshQA strict rules. Includes the test harness, answer keys, results and an MCP server.
